<!-- Every word the app shows or says (docs/DESIGN.md: sentence case, plain words, a visible label that matches what
     TalkBack says), so it can be translated. The screens read them with stringResource; plain Kotlin with Words
     (Words.kt), whose JVM tests read this file. The same words as the iOS app's (Text("…"), gathered in
     Localizable.xcstrings): change one, change the other. What a game says, and the help pages, come from content/
     and games/, not from here. -->
